FIX ROUND 1 for lanes A (hot-aisle\campaign\run3\) and C (hot-aisle\campaign\availability\).

Read build-2026-09-24\review-fable-on-A-C.md: a peer review of your own work. Fix the items listed below. Rules are unchanged from COMMON-BUILD.md: write only in those two directories, stdlib only, no commits.

LANE A, required:
1. Backend extraction (review 1a).
   - Parse `Overriding with (X)` as the selected attention backend. Also parse `Using X backend (selected via --attention-backend)`.
