2. Start the "missed" count at each row's first API observation; label earlier hours "not sampled".
3. README: say that DigitalOcean's `available`/`regions` flags are configuration availability and may not move with capacity. UNVERIFIED until compared with console observations: on 2026-09-23 the console showed H200 out of capacity in all regions. Note the alert noise when the all-unknown exit 1 fires every 15 minutes before tokens exist.
4. Add a pagination fixture (`links.pages.next`).
5. Rerun tests. Append a "Fix round 1" section to availability\BUILD-REPORT.md.

